{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/f270b9f2cd73c54e9cb8d95a8dcd9512.avif?t=1770127145\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164Every journey shifts the perspective \u2013 it grows with the traveler. <br>\u3164\u3164\u3164Our game tells a story about self-exploration, transformation and understanding of the world around us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/4004476e231d78108fb7e312df63ec5b.poster.avif?t=1770127145\" width=614 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/4004476e231d78108fb7e312df63ec5b.webm?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/4004476e231d78108fb7e312df63ec5b.mp4?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's story is inspired by real events from the early days of space exploration, when animals were the first to venture beyond Earth. Many of them never returned. This game is a tribute to those early pioneers, told through the story of Bea - a dog who, in our story, beats the odds and finds her own path among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/28d392985dabff9ef7b9392e6cd57a03.poster.avif?t=1770127145\" width=614 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/28d392985dabff9ef7b9392e6cd57a03.webm?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/28d392985dabff9ef7b9392e6cd57a03.mp4?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/d46d5690ffc1d9a5cfa45d41467e643f.avif?t=1770127145\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bea is a cheerful and brave companion-but at heart, she\u2019s still just a dog. She barks, wags her tail, and discovers the world through her senses. Her instincts are key to gameplay: sniffing, listening, and observing form the core of a detective mode that helps her explore and make sense of her surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/5b9ee666f147615e3349e4bc9c7da1d1.poster.avif?t=1770127145\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/5b9ee666f147615e3349e4bc9c7da1d1.webm?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/5b9ee666f147615e3349e4bc9c7da1d1.mp4?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/03d75b8d99e30754a20e744a66c09f9d.avif?t=1770127145\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164Join Bea on her journey through space as she explores all kinds of unique planets! <br>\u3164\u3164\u3164Each one is full of different creatures - some might become her buddies, while others... not so much. <br>\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164Get ready for an exciting adventure packed with surprises and new worlds to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882980?t=1770127145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/9aa553a9472aff6ee28ff4da3798131e81925d07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770127145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/6ee383560dfaacb699dbb72538498a81f3bb7ee0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770127145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/6ee383560dfaacb699dbb72538498a81f3bb7ee0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770127145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/f270b9f2cd73c54e9cb8d95a8dcd9512.avif?t=1770127145\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164Every journey shifts the perspective \u2013 it grows with the traveler. <br>\u3164\u3164\u3164Our game tells a story about self-exploration, transformation and understanding of the world around us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_im