</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bea is a cheerful and brave companion-but at heart, she\u2019s still just a dog. She barks, wags her tail, and discovers the world through her senses. Her instincts are key to gameplay: sniffing, listening, and observing form the core of a detective mode that helps her explore and make sense of her surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/5b9ee666f147615e3349e4bc9c7da1d1.poster.avif?t=1770127145\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/5b9ee666f147615e3349e4bc9c7da1d1.webm?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/5b9ee666f147615e3349e4bc9c7da1d1.mp4?t=1770127145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882980/extras/03d75b8d99e30754a20e744a66c09f9d.avif?t=1770127145\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164Join Bea on her journey through space as she explores all kinds of unique planets! <br>\u3164\u3164\u3164Each one is full of different creatures - some might become her buddies, while others... not so much. <br>\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164Get ready for an exciting adventure packed with surprises and new worlds to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Enjoy Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st